{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_23_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"一、十有二年，春，正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"二、夏，六月，壬寅，公會紀侯、莒子，盟於曲池。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，丁亥，公會宋人，燕人，盟於穀丘。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"四、八月，壬辰，陳侯躍卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"五、公會宋公於虛。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"六、冬，十有一月，公會宋公於龜。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"七、丙戌，公會鄭伯，盟於武父。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"八、丙戌，衞侯晉卒。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"九、十有二月，及鄭師伐宋。丁未，戰於宋。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_23_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_23","textTraditional":"非所與伐戰也。不言與鄭戰，恥不和也。於伐與戰，敗也。內諱敗，舉其可道者也。","sentenceOrder":10}],"overrides":{}}